{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"AIDotNet.OpenCowork","latestVersion":"1.4.0","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.7436c9c5.png","priority":1,"sha256":"7436c9c5cbff57972b465a797c53db13d3bec814f7db722fa092457c1dc2bda1","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Open-source desktop platform for multi-agent collaboration. Empowering AI agents with local tools, parallel teamwork, and seamless workplace integration.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Open-source desktop platform for multi-agent collaboration. Empowering AI agents with local tools, parallel teamwork, and seamless workplace integration.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Traditional LLM interfaces are often \"environment-isolated islands.\" Developers spend 50% of their time copy-pasting code, terminal logs, and file contents between the chat and their IDE.\nOpenCowork solves this by providing:\n- Local Agency: Agents can directly read/write files and execute shell commands with your permission.\n- Context Awareness: No more manual context feeding. Agents explore your codebase and logs autonomously.\n- Task Orchestration: Complex tasks (like \"Refactor this module and update tests\") are broken down and handled by specialized sub-agents.\n- Human-in-the-loop: You stay in control with a transparent tool-call approval system.","name":"OpenCoWork","packageUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork","publisher":"example.com","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/releases/tag/1.4.0","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"开源桌面多智能体协作平台，为 AI 智能体赋予本地工具、并行团队协作及无缝办公集成能力。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"传统的 LLM 界面往往是“环境孤岛”。开发者通常需要花费 50% 的时间在聊天窗口和 IDE 之间手动复制粘贴代码、终端日志和文件内容。\nOpenCowork 通过以下方式解决这一问题：\n- 本地代理能力：智能体可以在您的许可下直接读写文件并执行 Shell 命令。\n- 上下文感知：无需再手动喂数据。智能体会自主探索您的代码库和日志。\n- 任务编排：复杂的任务（如“重构此模块并更新测试”）会被拆解并由专门的子智能体处理。\n- 人在回路：通过透明的工具调用审批系统，您始终拥有最终控制权。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/releases/tag/1.4.0","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Traditional LLM interfaces are often \"environment-isolated islands.\" Developers spend 50% of their time copy-pasting code, terminal logs, and file contents between the chat and their IDE.\nOpenCowork solves this by providing:\n- Local Agency: Agents can directly read/write files and execute shell commands with your permission.\n- Context Awareness: No more manual context feeding. Agents explore your codebase and logs autonomously.\n- Task Orchestration: Complex tasks (like \"Refactor this module and update tests\") are broken down and handled by specialized sub-agents.\n- Human-in-the-loop: You stay in control with a transparent tool-call approval system.","name":"OpenCoWork","packageUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork","publisher":"example.com","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/AIDotNet/OpenCowork/releases/tag/1.4.0","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.4.0/app.json","detailSha256":"8ea82b6076ee492e86d660826dd5aa5c4bbb6fe0ea8d469b06b18cb6da1d79b1","releaseDate":"2026-09-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.4.0"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.3.27/app.json","detailSha256":"29bb05948db791d20f249354c546873d1619d614e233a9ae38da61d4327d62e4","releaseDate":"2026-09-01","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.3.27"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.3.26/app.json","detailSha256":"3f93d8bf580619480e89dc7371ea7e4ef9c0f4b71f1fda886e979d041adbcd1b","releaseDate":"2026-0